### Case: alg-none — a token whose header declares {"alg":"none"} and which carries
### no signature at all. Expect 401.
### This case exists because accept_unsupported_alg DEFAULTS TO TRUE on this plugin
### ("Ignore ID token signature to accept unsupported signature algorithm"), and
### accept_none_alg exists as a separate switch. Both are set false in the spec.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/posts
authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJzdWIiOiJhdHRhY2tlciIsImlzcyI6ImF0dGFja2VyIn0.
accept: application/json
